/* Adaptive lesson curriculum. Each lesson introduces new keys and
   reinforces previously learned ones. The lesson page generates a stream
   restricted to its `keys` set -- the same word picker, but filtered.

   Stages:
     1-24  Foundation       -- home row → numbers → punctuation
     25-32 Capitalization   -- shift drills, acronyms, proper nouns
     33-44 Numbers & symbols-- digit row, brackets, math, currency
     45-56 Programming      -- JS / Python / HTML / CSS / SQL / Bash / etc.
     57-72 Long-form prose  -- public-domain literary excerpts
     73-80 Specialized      -- legal, medical, screenplay, chess, etc.

   Each lesson definition supports:
     id        unique numeric ID, used in URLs
     title     human label
     keys      string of allowed chars OR null
     adaptive  bool -- pull from the model's weak-key picker
     source    "short" | "long" | "punctuation" | "numbers" |
               "literal" (use `text` verbatim) | "code-<lang>"
     text      literal lesson text (when source === "literal")
     difficulty 1-5
     tags      array of category tags
     bestFor   short blurb for the lesson card
*/

